flowchart LR
  Identity[Verified login identity] --> User[Resolve permanent User]
  User --> Status{Account active?}
  Status -->|No| Deny[Reject access]
  Status -->|Yes| Session[Issue validated session]
  Session --> Role[Read User.role from database]
  Role --> Policy[RENTipid authorization policy]
  Policy --> Allow[Allow permitted action]
  Policy --> Deny
  External[Provider profile claims] -. never assign internal role .-> Deny
